B.a5E=new A.hn("Indian International Student Ministry","A family away from home for Indian international students across the Chicago area, including UIC, IIT, Lewis University, DePaul, NIU and North Central College. Fellowship and Indian festivals, academic and career guidance, airport pickups, help with housing and transportation, home-cooked Indian meals, and worship in a culturally familiar setting.","assets/master4.png","Join us on Sundays")
